---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../../lib/ui";

const crypto = [
  { name: "BTC (Bitcoin)", addr: "YOUR-BITCOIN-ADDRESS" },
  { name: "USDT (TRC-20)", addr: "YOUR-USDT-TRC20-ADDRESS" },
  { name: "ETH / USDC (ERC-20)", addr: "YOUR-ETHEREUM-ADDRESS" },
];
---

<Layout locale="en" title="Support HKP4 · Donate" nav="donate">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Support HKP4</h1>
      <p class="sub">支持 HKP4 — 打賞與資助</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="max-width:44rem">
      <p>
        HKP4 has no institutional funding and no ads; every article stays free forever.
        One piece — research, argument, then a full English translation — takes well over
        ten hours. Your support is where those hours come from.
      </p>

      <h2>Option 1: Patreon membership (recommended)</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={site.patreon} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{site.patreon}</a>
        — from the price of a coffee per month, cancel anytime. Members read each issue
        48 hours early and see the sources and reasoning behind it. Patreon requires
        creators to verify their identity; it is the only step where you are not anonymous
        to the platform (readers still only see the pen name).
      </p>

      <h2>Option 2: One-off crypto tip (fully anonymous)</h2>
      <p>No personal data is collected; tips are irreversible, so check addresses carefully.</p>
      <ul>
        {crypto.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <strong>{c.name}</strong><br />
            <code>{c.addr}</code>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:0.85rem">
        (Before launch, replace the placeholder addresses with your own wallet addresses
        and verify each with a small test transfer.)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
